    "title": "This Used to Be My Playground program | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nThis Used to Be My Playground program\nThis Used to Be My Playground program, 1 to 3 p.m., Lewes Elementary School, 820 Savannah Rd., Lewes. Hosted by Lewes African American Heritage Commission. Panelists will share memories of Lewes Community Playground prior to development of Shipcarpenter Square, light refreshments served, free, RSVP requested. To register go to tinyurl.com/2eup6swy.\nEvent Date:\nSat, 02/21/2026 - 1:00pm to 3:00pm",
